Z||000008||banditbalz||11-18-2001||03:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrfiero:<BR><B><BR>Now John has painted it a disgusting dark purple/brownish color and made it a targa. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I have seen and heard John Norman's Northstar in person. One of the most beautiful Fiero's I have seen. The deep purple and contrasting yellow look sweet! On NOS it apparently runs 11 sec. quarter mile passes (according to HotRod magazine). I have hundreds of pics of John's Fiero, unfortunately I am running a remote computer and don't have access to them at this time. May post pics later if anyone shows interest...<P><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||1
